{"Title":"An Act relative to the Massachusetts Department of Transportation ","BillNumber":"H3444","DocketNumber":"HD3098","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"WMS1","Name":"William M. Straus","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WMS1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T09:30:19.327"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"WMS1","Name":"William M. Straus","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/WMS1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T09:30:19.3266667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3444/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Straus of Mattapoisett, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3444) of William M. Straus for legislation to enhance delivery of Massachusetts Department of Transportation capital projects.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1.  Section 3 of chapter 6C of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2014 Official Edition, is hereby amended by striking, in lines 173-174, the words “and sections 44A to 44H, inclusive, of chapter 149”. \r\n\tSECTION 2.  Section 14 of said chapter 6C, as so appearing, is hereby amended by striking, in line 3, the words “and sections 44A to 44H, inclusive, of chapter 149”. \r\n\tSECTION 3.  Subsection (1) of section 44A of chapter 149 of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by inserting, in line 12, after the word “authority” the following words:-\r\n\t“and the Massachusetts department of transportation”.\r\n\tSECTION 4.  Section 15 of chapter 149A of the General Laws, as so appearing, is hereby amended by striking, in line 1, the figure “8” and inserting in place thereof the following figure:-  21.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":"Whereas, The deferred operation of this act would tend to defeat its purpose, which is to enhance delivery of Massachusetts Department of Transportation capital projects, therefore it is hereby declared to be an emergency law, necessary for the immediate preservation of the public convenience.\r\n\r\n","RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}